  'Oyiga bir marta bir xil joyda, bir xil yorug\'likda rasm oling — o\'zgarish tarozidan ko\'ra rasmda yaxshiroq ko\'rinadi. Rasmni faqat siz va treneringiz ko\'radi.': 'Once a month take a photo in the same spot and lighting — changes show better in photos than on the scale. Only you and your trainer can see them.',
