  'Oyoqni orqaga ko\'tarish (blokda)': 'Cable glute kickback',
  'Ozish': 'Weight loss',
  'Ozish uchun — 75 kg, 65 kg va 60 kg li insonlar uchun. Kotta Qani zal.\n\nNonushta: ovsyanka bo\'tqasi 50 g va tuxum omleti — piyoz bilan aralashtirib, soya yog\'ida qovurilsa bo\'ladi. 2 dona tuxum, 1 tasining sarig\'ini olib tashlaymiz.\n\n10:30 — keyingi nonushta: 50 g yong\'oq va meva (olma) yoki 1 porsiya protein.\n\n12:30 — tushlik: 50 g grechka yoki guruch, yonida kotlet yoki go\'sht yoki qaynatilgan 4 ta tuxum oqi. Go\'shtlarning grammi — 150 g norma.\n\n16:00 — poldnik: 1 porsiya protein. Agar mashg\'ulot bo\'lsa — faqat 50 g grechkaning o\'zini qaynatib, ustiga qatiq, ya\'ni kefir qo\'shib aralashtirib yeysiz.\n\nMashg\'ulotdan keyin yana 1 porsiya protein. Qo\'rqmang, zarari yo\'q — protein oddiy oqsil qo\'shimchasi.\n\n19:00 — kechki ovqat: salat (ko\'katlar, pomidor, bodring, bolgar qalampiri) va baliq 150 g, yoki go\'sht dimlangan holda.\n\nBundan tashqari, sport qo\'shimchalaridan vitamin komplekslar va protein olishingiz shart.': 'For weight loss — for people weighing 75 kg, 65 kg and 60 kg. Kotta Qani gym.\n\nBreakfast: 50 g oat porridge and an omelette — it can be mixed with onion and fried in soybean oil. 2 eggs, remove the yolk from one.\n\n10:30 — second breakfast: 50 g walnuts and fruit (an apple), or 1 serving of protein.\n\n12:30 — lunch: 50 g buckwheat or rice with a cutlet, or meat, or 4 boiled egg whites. The meat portion is 150 g.\n\n16:00 — afternoon snack: 1 serving of protein. If you have a workout — just 50 g of boiled buckwheat mixed with kefir.\n\nAfter the workout, another serving of protein. Don\'t worry, it does no harm — protein is an ordinary protein supplement.\n\n19:00 — dinner: salad (greens, tomato, cucumber, bell pepper) and 150 g of fish, or stewed meat.\n\nIn addition, you must take vitamin complexes and protein from sports supplements.',
